  "html": "R Thread Self Drilling Anchor Bolt System"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "sm",
  "html": "Description:<br>R thread self drilling anchor bolt system performs drilling, grouting &amp; anchoring in one step. Easy to process and no risks of drill hole collapse. Suitable for unstable conditions."
 },
